[[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/194002126\">Op. 1016A10 SOUND-PROOFING COVER - R.R</a></p><p><a href=\"#/194002167\">Op. 1048B19 TURBOCHARGER AIR OUTLET HOSE -R.R.</a></p><p>1. Loosen the bands (1a) and remove the oil vapour pipe from the tappet cover to the intake (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194003622.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Place the oil vapour pipe from the tappet cover to the intake back in its housing and secure it using the bands.</p><p><a href=\"#/194002167\">Op. 1048B19 TURBOCHARGER AIR OUTLET HOSE -R.R.</a></p><p><a href=\"#/194002126\">Op. 1016A10 SOUND-PROOFING COVER - R.R</a></p>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Move the retaining clips back, disconnect and remove the oil vapour pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194005283.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\